+# phase2_code_rev_c.yaml: CODE ANALYSIS inputs for P2-G-002 Rev C. Rev B inputs stay in phase2_code_rev_b.yaml (Rev B unchanged;
+# P2-A-111 Rev C / A-103 Rev B keep reading Rev B loads, which Rev C does not change).
+# Rev C = Shane 2026-10-04 5:03 PM CT ("go, keep core 2 east"; Claude Code session covering for KEYSTONE): D-069 CLOSED = Option 2
+# (Shane 3:31 PM CT), core 2 confirmed on the EAST wall at V2 (D-070). Areas = plan Rev I (phase2_plan_rev_i.yaml): L1 grows by the
+# 1,680 SF bump-out only; occupant loads unchanged (restrooms not added, R-018.1 method). Fixture table = lobby core + core 2 as drawn
+# vs the chairs-only requirement (phase2_program.yaml rev_k.fixture_split). Open item "D-069 OPEN" replaced by the closed note.
+# Rev B header (kept for history):
+# phase2_code_rev_b.yaml: CODE ANALYSIS inputs for P2-G-002 Rev B (and P2-A-111 Rev B / P2-A-103 Rev B via p2_g_002.compute(rev="B")).
+# Rev B = Shane 2026-10-04 1:21-1:22 PM CT: D-054 DECIDED chairs-only event floor (design case = chairs; L1 exits kept as drawn
+# for standing = extra margin), D-064 DECIDED Option 2 (restrooms to chairs-only; posted occupant load per configuration, IBC 1004.9;
+# temporary units for anything larger), D-065 DECIDED (screening bay), D-067 storage annex (S-1, 300 gross). Areas = plan Rev H
+# (phase2_plan_rev_h.yaml) for Level 1, Rev F for Level 2. Rev A inputs stay in phase2_code.yaml (P2-G-002 Rev A FROZEN).
+# Rev A header (kept for history):
+# KEYSTONE Phase 2 — CODE ANALYSIS inputs (P2-G-002). Created 2026-10-04 10:48 AM CT (Shane: next backlog item P2-T-007).
+# Contents come from cited research notes only: R-006 (editions / AHJ), R-007 (occupancy, load factors), R-009 (fixtures),
+# R-015 (sprinklers, voice alarm, exits, main exit), R-018 (L2 egress), R-019 / R-022 (heights), R-021 (area basis).
+# Sections looked up this session are quoted in R-007.3 (IBC 2021 ch. 10 box copy research_src/upc_ibc10.txt, UpCodes).
+# Areas = P2-A-101/102 Rev F as drawn (phase2_plan_rev_f.yaml rects). Not a code review: architect of record + AHJ confirm.
+
+meta:
