+  file: P2-G-002_RevC
+  size: "17 x 11 in (tabloid), landscape"
+  scale: NTS
+  disclaimer: "Design basis for the architect of record and the AHJ. Not a code review and no statement of approval: every line needs architect + AHJ confirmation (D-008). Values from KEYSTONE research notes; IBC 2021 text read on UpCodes (Alabama)."
+  source: "Shane 2026-10-04 10:48 AM CT (P2-G-002 Rev A: schematic set style, title block, PRELIMINARY stamp; contents from cited R-files)"
+
+editions:
+  rows:
+    - {code: "Building", designed: "IBC 2021 (ASSUMED, Shane)", county: "IBC 2018 (Madison County, since 2021-01-01)", status: "verify with AHJ (D-008)", source: "R-006.2 S1-S3"}
