+# the corridor. Loads: params/phase2_code_rev_d.yaml via p2_g_002.compute("D") (unchanged totals; X11 adds 64 in).
+# Rev C inputs stay in phase2_life_safety_rev_c.yaml (P2-A-111 Rev C APPROVED, D-071).
