+# Rev C = Shane 2026-10-04 3:31 PM CT: D-069 CLOSED = Option 2, east restroom bump-out (core 2) on plan Rev I; recheck travel, common
+# path and exit separation. X7 moves 30 ft east to the bump-out face; EXIT (E) continues through the bump-out as the core corridor.
+# Geometry: params/phase2_plan_rev_i.yaml; loads: params/phase2_code_rev_b.yaml via p2_g_002.compute("B") (unchanged: restrooms are
+# accessory, no load added). Rev B inputs stay in phase2_life_safety_rev_b.yaml.
+# Rev B header (kept for history):
+# phase2_life_safety_rev_b.yaml: P2-A-111 LIFE SAFETY PLAN Rev B inputs. Read by phase2/src/p2_a_111.py --rev B.
