+# Option 1 screening bay (E1 egress re-checked with the bay), D-066 40 ft walk (discharge check), D-064 restrooms -> D-069 OPEN,
+# D-067 storage annex. Geometry: params/phase2_plan_rev_h.yaml; loads: params/phase2_code_rev_b.yaml via p2_g_002.compute("B").
+# Rev A inputs stay in phase2_life_safety.yaml (P2-A-111 Rev A APPROVED + FROZEN, D-068).
+# Rev A header (kept for history):
+# phase2_life_safety.yaml: P2-A-111 LIFE SAFETY PLAN (SCHEMATIC), Levels 1 + 2 (Phase 2). Read by phase2/src/p2_a_111.py.
+# Rev A, 2026-10-04 (Shane 11:07 AM CT): exits with capacities and egress widths, occupant loads per P2-G-002 Rev A (worst case,
