+# (1/3 diagonal, sprinklered), E1 8-pair door bank (Option 1 DECIDED). Geometry: params/phase2_plan_rev_g.yaml (Level 1 = P2-A-101
+# Rev G; Level 2 = Rev F, unchanged). Loads and egress factors: params/phase2_code.yaml via p2_g_002.compute().
+# Units: feet on plan (origin = SW building corner, x east, y north), inches for egress widths.
+# Status: every travel path is a KEYSTONE diagram measurement (rectilinear, along open floor, LOW confidence) — UNVERIFIED until the
+# architect lays out walls, doors, aisles and seating. Not a code review (D-008).
